Package: branchenapp
Type: Shiny App
Title: Branchenstruktur Kanton Thurgau
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Amt für Daten und Statistik", "Kanton Thurgau",
    email = "felixlorenz18@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Amt für Daten und Statistik Kanton Thurgau <felixlorenz18@gmail.com>
Description: A Shiny dashboard visualizing the employment structure
    (Branchenstruktur) of the canton of Thurgau, Switzerland, based on open
    government data (OGD) from the Bundesamt für Statistik (STATENT). For
    each NOGA economic sector it shows employee counts, ten-year growth, and
    the location quotient relative to Switzerland as a whole, at the Kanton,
    Bezirk and Gemeinde level.
